OPENING CONTEXT: \begin{theorem}[Invariants of the weighted OS45 manifold]\hypertarget{tag-02LV}{}\label{maps:src:D.2.53}
{\normalfont\scriptsize tag 02LV}\par
The manifold $X$ of Definition~\ref{maps:def:weighted-os45-data}
is simply connected and has
\begin{equation}
 H_2(X;\mathbb Z)=\mathbb Z^{15}\oplus\mathbb Z/8,\qquad
 H_3(X;\mathbb Z)=\mathbb Z/8,\qquad
 c_1(X)=c_2(X)=\lambda(X)=0.                              \hypertarget{tag-022O}{}\label{maps:eq:D.OS1}
\end{equation}
Its sixteen normalized cusp components are indexed by
\((r,s)\in\mathbb Z/8\times\mathbb Z/2\), with \(i=2r+s\).
